   "title": "The Helene Zoller Garden",
   "lead": "<p>ZOLLER places great emphasis on sustainable landscaping and environmental awareness. A central element of this philosophy is the natural stone wall that has been integrated into the Helene Zoller Garden. In this garden, the stone wall serves not only as a decorative element but, above all, as a valuable contribution to the ecological balance. It creates important habitats for numerous animal species, such as lizards, insects, and small mammals.</p>",
