    {
     "type": "textmedia",
     "header": "",
     "body": "<p>The bee sanctuary at ZOLLER is more than just a refuge for our own bee colonies; it is a living example of sustainable nature conservation and the preservation of biodiversity. Through a combination of our own bee colonies, high-quality flower mixes, and careful maintenance, we contribute to the protection of bees while also providing delicious honey for our customers.</p>",
